    "text": "By Editorials ,\n12 hours ago The Brandywine Youth Club 12u Bulldogs baseball team has made history this year. For the first time ever, the team is headed to the Cal Ripken 12u World Series from Aug. 5-15 in Branson, Missouri and is asking for the public’s help to offset the cost of the trip. Read full article",
